# Solution to PUZZLE 4. Root 220, minor third 220 × 6/5 = 264,
# fifth 220 × 3/2 = 330. Writing the ratios out works too:
# osc(sin, 220 * 6 / 5) and osc(sin, 220 * 3 / 2).
#
#@ peak 220 3 -15 -- the root, 220 Hz
#@ peak 264 3 -15 -- the minor third, 6/5 of the root
#@ peak 330 3 -15 -- the fifth, 3/2 of the root
#@ nopeak 275 4 -35 -- no major third (that would make it major)

play chord:
  (osc(sin, 220)
   + osc(sin, 264)
   + osc(sin, 330)) * 0.08

chord
